      "id": 3931998158915,
      "title": "Classic\u2122",
      "handle": "classic",
      "body_html": "<h1>BlenderBottle New Classic Shaker Cup\u00a0</h1>\n<p><span>The world's best-selling shaker cup gets and upgrade. The new and improved Classic\u2122 shaker gives our tried-and-true best-selling bottle an impressive overhaul with modern design elements and pro-level performance features. Forgot to add liquid first? No sweat. The rounded base allows the BlenderBall\u00ae whisk to mix every last bit of powder adding even more mixing power to the market's best protein shaker.\u00a0</span></p>\n<h3 id=\"magicdomid4\">Design</h3>\n<div>Tried. True. Totally Improved.\u00a0</div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid6\">\n<ul>\n<li>The new and improved Classic\u2122\u00a0shaker gives our tried-and-true best-selling bottle an impressive overhaul with modern design\u00a0elements\u00a0and pro-level\u00a0performance\u00a0features.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"magicdomid8\">Performance</h3>\n<div>Perfectly Smooth.</div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid10\">\n<ul>\n<li>Say goodbye to lumpy protein shakes. Our patented mixing system uses the BlenderBall\u00ae wire whisk\u2014found only in BlenderBottle\u00ae brand shakers\u2014to deliver smooth protein and nutrition shakes with ease.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid11\"></div>\n<h3 id=\"magicdomid12\">Upgraded Lid</h3>\n<div>Spoutguard\u2122.</div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid14\">\n<ul>\n<li>The Classic\u2122 shaker\u00a0sports\u00a0an updated lid featuring a wider carry loop, ergonomic flip cap, and SpoutGuard\u2122 to keep dirty gym fingers off the drinking surface.\u00a0Our leak proof guarantee means you can toss the bottle in your gym bag and not worry when it tips.\u00a0</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid15\"></div>\n<h3 id=\"magicdomid16\">Enhanced Mixing</h3>\n<div>Rounded Base.</div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid18\">\n<ul>\n<li>Forgot to add liquid first? No sweat. The rounded base allows the BlenderBall\u00ae whisk to mix every last bit of powder.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid19\" class=\"\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid20\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-eILLZipQKUDb color-FFFFFF author-eILLZipQKUDb color\"><span>Carry Loop</span></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid21\" class=\"\">\n<ul class=\"list-indent1\">\n<li><span class=\"author-eILLZipQKUDb color-FFFFFF author-eILLZipQKUDb color\"><span>Clip It, Loop It, Hang It.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid22\" class=\"\">\n<ul class=\"list-indent2\">\n<li><span class=\"author-eILLZipQKUDb color-FFFFFF author-eILLZipQKUDb color\"><span>Integrated with the StayOpen\u2122 flip cap, the adjustable carry loop lets you hold more when your hands are full and offers a convenient place to attach keys while at the gym.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<div id=\"magicdomid20\" class=\"\"><span class=\"author-eILLZipQKUDb color-FFFFFF author-eILLZipQKUDb color\"><span>Leak-Proof Guarantee\u00a0</span></span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid21\" class=\"\">\n<ul class=\"list-indent1\">\n<li><span class=\"author-eILLZipQKUDb color-FFFFFF author-eILLZipQKUDb color\"><span>Sick of protein shaker leaks? As always, every BlenderBottle brand shaker cup comes with a leak proof shaker guarantee.\u00a0</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>BlenderBottle\u00a0classic\u00a0shaker cups sport our updated lid, featuring a wider carry loop, SpoutGuard protection to keep dirty gym fingers at bay, and a more ergonomic flip cap. With our leak proof guarantee, you can rest assured that you have a secure seal, whether you're mixing a shake or just drinking water. Say 'goodbye' to lumpy protein shakes and 'hello' to smooth, great-tasting drinks. The patented BlenderBall wire whisk -- found only in BlenderBottle shaker cups -- whips around inside the bottle as you shake, delivering unparalleled mixing. Add ingredients like peanut butter, applesauce, or yogurt to your protein or meal replacement, and the BlenderBall whisk blends them together with ease. Like all BlenderBottle brand shaker cups, our Pro series shakers are made using high-quality, BPA- and phthalate-free materials. The Pro45 boasts a massive 45-ounce capacity, built to fit virtually any mass gainer shake, multiple scoops of a recovery drink, or enough water to keep you hydrated with minimal refills.\u00a0</p>\n<ul>\n<li>BlenderBall whisk inside</li>\n<li>SpoutGuard</li>\n<li>Rounded base</li>\n<li>Stain &amp; odor resistant</li>\n<li>Leak-proof guarantee</li>\n<li>Wide mouth makes it easy to add ingredients and to clean</li>\n<li>StayOpen flip cap won't close on your nose</li>\n<li>Embossed ounce and milliliter markings</li>\n<li>Fits in most car drink holders</li>\n<li>BPA and Phthalate free</li>\n<li>Dishwasher Safe</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The really big shaker cup Pro45 is now the Classic 45 oz shaker. Adding size to the world's top shaker.\u00a0</p>\n<p>big shaker cup</p>\n<p>large shaker cup</p>\n<p><span>\u00a045 oz</span></p>\n<p><span>Sizes</span></p>\n<p><span>20 oz - small blender bottle</span></p>\n<p><span>small shaker cup</span></p>\n<p><span>28 oz - medium blender bottle</span></p>\n<p>large shaker cup</p>\n<p><span>45 oz</span></p>\n<p>42 oz\u00a0</p>\n<p>40 oz</p>\n<p>deadlift</p>\n<p>amor</p>\n<p>amour</p>\n</div>",
