      "title": "One Piece - Pro Series",
      "handle": "one-piece-pro-series",
      "body_html": "<p>Bring the spirit of the Straw Hat Pirates to every workout. The\u00a0<strong data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"678\">One Piece\u2122 Pro Series</strong> features bold designs inspired by <strong data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"739\">Luffy, Zoro, and Sanji</strong>, pairing your favorite characters with BlenderBottle's trusted mixing performance. Whether you're training, fueling up, or chasing your next adventure, these bottles are built to keep up.<br><br>Built with odor-resistant Eastman Tritan\u2122, a leak-proof lid, 28oz size, and the BlenderBall\u00ae wire whisk, they're ready for every workout, adventure, and Grand Line journey<br></p>",
