    {
      "id": 8419989356742,
      "title": "One Small Step - Pro Series",
      "handle": "one-small-step-pro-series",
      "body_html": "<p>The Pro Series shaker bottle is designed for perfectly mixed shakes and reliable hydration, whether you're hitting the gym or just staying active. Featuring the BlenderBall\u00ae wire whisk, it delivers smooth, lump-free drinks every time. Made from durable, BPA-free plastic and designed to resist odors, the ProSeries stays fresh even through your toughest workouts.</p>\n<p>Key Features: \u00a0<br>- BlenderBall\u00ae wire whisk for smooth mixing \u00a0<br>- Odor-resistant, BPA-free plastic \u00a0<br>- Durable design for daily use \u00a0<br>- Subscriber perks like discounted pricing, early access, and exclusive sales</p>\n<p>The ProSeries is a top pick for athletes and fitness enthusiasts who value quality and convenience.</p>",
